00:24:15,680 --> 00:24:16,680
Nope.

86
00:24:16,680 --> 00:24:17,680
So you might think hmm.

87
00:24:17,680 --> 00:24:22,760
And then furthermore there's also a frequent undertone of we all know that it's the long

88
00:24:22,760 --> 00:24:23,760
run plan that's better.

89
00:24:23,760 --> 00:24:26,760
Ever known anyone with really stupid long run plans?

