00:25:04,040 --> 00:25:05,040
Right.

106
00:25:05,040 --> 00:25:10,080
Or you know someone who only eats what they consider super healthy food, consider that

107
00:25:10,080 --> 00:25:11,080
living.

108
00:25:11,080 --> 00:25:15,080
Is that really actually a worthwhile life?

109
00:25:15,080 --> 00:25:20,600
So you know I'll give an honest answer of how many extra years of healthy life would

110
00:25:20,600 --> 00:25:25,200
you have to have to never eat meat or sugar again?

111
00:25:25,200 --> 00:25:26,200
Yeah.

112
00:25:26,200 --> 00:25:31,200
It's like some of my, two of my very favorite things in life.

113
00:25:31,200 --> 00:25:32,200
Right.

114
00:25:32,200 --> 00:25:35,440
So it was like well like is there anything, like what substitutes are available?

115
00:25:35,440 --> 00:25:36,440
Let me try this.

116
00:25:36,440 --> 00:25:37,440
I was like ugh.

117
00:25:37,440 --> 00:25:40,000
No I don't want to do that.

