01:36:45,360 --> 01:36:46,960
And I'm like, hey, isn't the same with soap?

306
01:36:46,960 --> 01:36:53,760
He said, no, soap physically removes germs, and it's very hard for the bacteria to get resistance to being physically wiped off your hands.

307
01:36:53,760 --> 01:36:59,560
But if it's just a chemical treatment, then you just wind up getting really strong bacteria on your hands.

308
01:36:59,560 --> 01:37:03,360
So I don't care. I'll shake your hand.

309
01:37:03,360 --> 01:37:04,160
Yeah.

310
01:37:04,160 --> 01:37:16,360
In medical settings, you're supposed to use hand sanitizer or some like-wise substance every three times and wash your hands a fourth time.

311
01:37:16,360 --> 01:37:18,360
And do that in a cycle.

312
01:37:18,360 --> 01:37:23,160
Right. I don't feel like the guy's doing it. I'm suspicious.

