01:37:33,760 --> 01:37:39,960
Yeah. Because like, oh, he's hassling the doctors for no reason at all.

318
01:37:39,960 --> 01:37:47,160
All right. So again, this is the kind of thing where it seems like people are rounding it down to zero.

