01:38:16,560 --> 01:38:21,160
There's always getting a second opinion, third opinion.

326
01:38:21,160 --> 01:38:24,960
All right. So anyway, so there's empirical evidence on both these things.

327
01:38:24,960 --> 01:38:29,760
As for what the logic is, when you set it to zero and when you make it too big,

328
01:38:29,760 --> 01:38:33,360
